  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1845\">\n<li data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1702\">\n<p data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1702\">The embryo shows <strong data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1603\">full HLA compatibility</strong> with the affected sibling and is suitable for potential hematopoietic stem cell transplantation.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1786\">\n<p data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1786\">The embryo <strong data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1757\">does not share full HLA compatibility</strong> with the affected sibling.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1845\">\n<p data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1845\">Additional embryos may be tested for a compatible match.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
